{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Wake up. Survive. Escape.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Experience a taste of <i><strong>SHOCK</strong></i>. This demo consists of a tuned version of the game's opening sequence, which is the second level of the parking lot, with a small section from the first level. Use stealth and strategy to escape the monster lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617980/extras/WakeUp.gif?t=1744306979\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617980/extras/Prone.gif?t=1744306979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617980/extras/Mix.gif?t=1744306979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What\u2019s Included in the Demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Parking Lot (first and second levels)</strong> \u2013 Navigate a haunting, multi-level parking structure filled with tension, scarce resources, and a relentless cybernetic threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teaser from the opening section</strong> \u2013 Includes a short introductory section from the opening area to establish tone and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stealth Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Outwit and evade an intelligent enemy using bricks and clever maneuvering where you have to leave your wheelchair behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you escape the nightmare before it consumes you? Only the strongest will survive in <strong>SHOCK</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617980?t=1744306979","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3